{
  "$comment": "NORMATIVE test data for ADR-014. Generated by interop/generate.mjs; do not hand-edit. An implementation is conformant iff it reproduces every `canonical` value byte-for-byte from the corresponding `input`, emits 64-byte raw R||S signatures, and reproduces the acceptance matrix below. Vector 01 is RFC 8785's own published test data.",
